                [
                    218.0,
                    1357.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "• We assume that daily CRSP volume and returns are a sufficient statistic for estimating firm-month-level  $ \\hat{\\lambda}_{it} $, while acknowledging that higher-frequency (intraday/TAQ) data would provide a more precise estimate of the continuous-time  $ \\lambda(t) $ path described in Proposition 4.",
